**
** The gravity and the centrifugal load of *DLOAD (GRAV, CENTRIF), read from this inp file alone.
** A block of 2 C3D20 elements (x from 0 to 2) of the density 1.0E-3 is fixed at x=0. GRAV is 10 in -z
** (the direction is given unnormalized), and CENTRIF has the square of the rotational speed 100 about the
** z-axis through (0, 0, 0). The loads sum to (0, 0, -0.02) and 1.0E-3 * 100 * (2, 1, 0) = (0.2, 0.1, 0).
